[FINAL ANSWER] The intelligent auto-scaling feature was 60% complete and became blocked because it was fundamentally dependent on the rolled-back monitoring system's advanced metrics, The project was split into two parts: immediate basic rule-based auto-scaling using simple CPU/memory thresholds (scale up when CPU > 80% for 5 minutes, scale down when CPU < 30% for 15 minutes) was implemented and completed, while advanced auto-scaling was deferred for future implementation when proper monitoring infrastructure becomes available.
